One OS can be used to run multiple different applications in separate Docker containers.

For example:

Linux OS
   │
   └── Docker
        │
        ├── Container 1 → Java application
        ├── Container 2 → MySQL
        ├── Container 3 → React application
        └── Container 4 → Nginx

All containers share the same Linux kernel, but each application is isolated from the others.

So remember:

1 OS → Docker → multiple isolated containers → different applications


  
